{"asset_key":"ep1/herohub_story_11411150","episode":"ep1","category":"herohub_story","story_id":"11411150","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:2:1141115001:1":{"text":"俺が見張りをしておくから、ゆっくり休むんだぞ。","source_cn":"好好休息，我可以守夜。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x76AD6D0DBC2A41A4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1141115002:1":{"text":"大丈夫だよ！僕たちに奇襲をかける人なんていないって。","source_cn":"没关系的！应该没有人敢过来偷袭我们。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7450A46339CA9743","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1141115003:1":{"text":"あんたもゆっくり休めよ、オレが見張っとく。","source_cn":"你也需要休息一下，我来放哨吧。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x922730618FD92E7E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1141115004:1":{"text":"若きババリアよ、お前は俺の相手になれそうだな。ご厚意に甘えるとしよう。","source_cn":"有望成为我的对手的年轻蛮血，我就接受你的好意了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8464B897BC1002FB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:沙奎尔":{"text":"シャキール","source":"沙奎尔","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:阿尔萨":{"text":"アルサ","source":"阿尔萨","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:索恩":{"text":"ソーン","source":"索恩","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":5,"localized_text_count":4,"speaker_count":3}}